## Superb mountain aqueducts

Industrial holdings of Lugano (AIL) SA — open position in Lugano/Muzzano (TI).

AIL SA Casella postale 6901 Lugano Centre Via Industria 2 6933 Muzzano Tel. 058 470 70 www.ail.ch
• info@ail.ch Who we are: We are a dynamic company in the energy sector and in the supply of drinking water, evolving and with a strong focus on innovation and development of people. We are looking for a passionate and motivated person for the role of Surveillance Mountain aqueducts What you will do concretely: you will perform preventive and curative maintenance of the sources collection plants, in particular:
• maintenance and cleaning of the collection systems of the sources, the collection rooms, the small tanks and the pipelines;
• maintenance of forest roads and mountain paths;
• control of the zones of protection of the catches;
• ensure and monitor the application of all necessary measures to ensure food safety. Who are you?
• you have an AFC in the technical field (Giardiniere, Selvicoltore, Muratore or similar);
• you have the attitude for outdoor work;
• you have a strong sense of responsibility, reliability and flexibility;
• you are dynamic and motivated in the course of the activity;
• you can use the Office 365 package;
• you have the license to conduct category B;
• you have the license to conduct BE category or availability to achieve it;
• you have the driver license of construction machines K-BFM category M1 or availability to achieve it;
• you have Swiss citizenship or a residence permit. What we offer:
• a varied and interesting activity, becoming part of a society in continuous evolution;
• a collaborative working environment, with ample space to bring ideas and innovation;
• flexibility and support to reconcile professional and personal life;
• possibility of further training and continuing training;
• Contractual conditions, insurance and social security. Attachment documents:
• motivational letter;
• complete dossier of curriculum vitae, diplomas and work certificates;
• copy of the identity document. At a later date, an excerpt from the execution and bankruptcy office will be required and an updated judicial checkout with a maximum validity of 3 months. End of the competition: Friday 10 July 2026. Please fill in the online application attached to the competition. We will carefully evaluate each dossier.

 Application deadline:* 2026-07- 11

Sector: Energy / Public Services

Sede: Via Industria 2, 6933 Muzzano (Lugano), TI, Switzerland

[Official note (PDF)](https://www.ail.ch/downloadJobPosition?uuid=314021a2-23ce-4e79-8cf5-e866c6857985)

